  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ、喜んで頂けたようで何よりです。\n実はこちら、当店イチオシのブレンドティーで……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（みんな、笑顔で楽しんでくれている。\n感謝祭をやれてよかった。……それにしても）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（手紙の件があったからかな。\nファンのみんなと一緒にいると）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（こんな風に分かりあえない、\n家族のことを考えてしまう……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……いつか一族とも、\nこうして語り合う時間はとれるのだろうか？）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（洋菓子の道に進みたい……そんな私の夢を、\n認めてもらえる日は来るのでしょうか）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（あたしが本当に好きなものについて、\n話せる日はくるのかな……？）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ダメダメ。もうすぐライブの時間なんだから。\n今は全力で、お客さんを楽しませなくっちゃ！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "ライブ後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-30:caption",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……ライブ、大成功でしたね！\nみんな、笑顔で俺たちのことを応援してくれて。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-32:text",
        "step_id": 32,
        "step_index": 31,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 31
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うむ！　我らの詠唱で、\nあれほど喜んでもらえるとは……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-33:text",
        "step_id": 33,
        "step_index": 32,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 32
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……あたしね、ステージに立って、\nあらためて気づいたことがあるんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "Cafe Paradeは、あたし達があたし達らしくいられる、\nもうひとつの居場所だってこと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それから……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そんなあたし達が集まったCafe Paradeには、\n誰かを幸せにする力があるってこと！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……ああ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（俺はまだ、自分勝手な子供のまま\nなのかもしれない……だけど）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-46:text",
        "step_id": 46,
        "step_index": 45,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 45
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（Cafe Paradeから世界中へ、幸せを届ける。\nそんな自分の夢を、追いかけ続けたい……！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-47:text",
        "step_id": 47,
        "step_index": 46,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 46
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……サキちゃん、俺もそう思うよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_h:step-51:text",
        "step_id": 51,
        "step_index": 50,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 50
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これからも一緒に、\nたくさんの笑顔と幸せを作っていこう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
